 1923:     // Permissions arrive on the wire (Unix mode bits). Apply best-effort
 1924:     // through the retained handle (fchmod, `File::set_permissions`)
 1925:     // rather than a by-path reopen; ignore failures (cross-fs, root-owned
 1926:     // dst, etc.).
